<<declare $gatorVisited = 0>>
<<if $gatorVisited==0>>
    Melion Bisclavret: Why so glum, Eugène.
    Eugène: Oh, hey Melion. Just got fired. 
    -> My condolences.
        Melion Bisclavret: I'm sorry to hear that.
        Eugène: Don't be, it's been a long time coming.
    -> Deserved, surely.
        Melion Bisclavret: You had it coming, slacker.
        Eugène: Ha ha. Thanks Melion. 
        Eugène: It's true, though.
    Melion Bisclavret: Who made the call? Renée?
    Eugène: Nah. Allard's just a product manager. Not much real power in that role.
    Eugène: It was the higher ups. Market's down right now. 
    Eugène: 'Downsizing'.
    Melion Bisclavret: Hm. I'm sure Renée didn't lift a finger to stop it, though.
    Eugène: Don't be unfair, Melion. It ain't personal.
    Eugène: 'Sides, I heard you're her boss now. She ain't gonna be thrilled.
    Melion Bisclavret: I still need to sign the papers in Tweed's office.
    Eugène: Mhm. Good luck getting there. Allard is already guarding the elevator.
    -> What about the stairs?
        Eugène: One of the execs greased em up. Scary guy wearing a brass mask.
        Melion Bisclavret: Gaurin... 
        Eugène: Oh, and someone else rigged up a bunch of booby traps. Tripwires, swinging blades, buzzsaws, the works.
        Eugène: Just like the ones in front of the printer. Seems like a fire hazard to me.
    -> No other way but through.
        Eugène: Not since that masked guy greased the stairs. One of the execs, I think.
        Melion Bisclavret: Gaurin... That's uncharacteristically tame for him.
        Eugène: I think it's just a distraction from booby traps. You know, tripwires, swinging blades, buzzsaws, the works.
        Eugène: Like the ones in front of the printer. Seems like a fire hazard to me.
    Melion Bisclavret: So I'll have to get past Renée...
    Eugène: Mhm.
    Eugène: Whatever's waiting for you down there, I can't say you don't deserve it.
    Melion Bisclavret: Whatever. 
    Eugène: Good luck, Melion. Let me know how it goes with Allard.
    Melion Bisclavret: Will do, Eugène.
    <<set $gatorVisited = 1>>
<<elseif $gatorVisited==1>>
    <<if $reneeVisited==1>>
        Eugène: So, you beat Allard. Wow.
        Melion Bisclavret: Indeed. 
        Eugène: Guess she's gonna leave now.
        Melion Bisclavret: Probably.
        Eugène: For the best, I think. 
        Melion Bisclavret: Mhm.
        Eugène: She's got ideas and ambition. Ain't no place for those here these days.
        Eugène: World's changing. This place has no future.
        Melion Bisclavret: You're just saying that because you got let go.
        Eugène: Maybe so. But you only disagree because you got promoted.
        <<set $gatorVisited=2>>
    <<endif>>
    Eugène: So it goes, Melion. So it goes.
<<elseif $gatorVisited==2>>
    Eugène: So it goes, Melion. So it goes.
<<endif>>
