        Melion Bisclavret: Nope. Everything is perfectly normal.
        Telephoner: Nothing at all?
    Melion Bisclavret: Well, our printer doesn't work anymore.
    Telephoner: That's not much of an anomaly.
    Telephoner: Anyway, I asked one of the IT people about my phone problem when she walked past earlier today...
